+Context from meeting with Mona:+

* Valentin works with Mona within her PNL responsibility
* Valentin is working on this giveaway with Ariana who provides him with local marketing support



+Waiting for Valentin to provide more details regarding the giveaway. Anticipated suggested response (+{color:#bf2600}+in red+{color}+)+:

* *Do they need to publish T&Cs on their bio?*

{color:#bf2600}If Bolt is part of the promotion of the campaign and is involved in the winner selection then, yes, T&Cs should be made readily available.{color}

{color:#bf2600}If we are only providing the partners with the codes, they will be responsible for managing the campaign and the give away.{color}

* *Can they give promo codes without T&Cs on their page?*

{color:#bf2600}If the partners are managing the campaign, it is their responsibility to make the T&Cs available on their page.{color}

* *What information must be written on the T&Cs?*

{color:#bf2600}Again, if it is the partner managing the campaign and Bolt is merely provide the prize, it is their responsibility to draft their own T&Cs. {color}

